5,1,1,talk,Shion,,We need to be logical about this. I'll check the partition wall to the office and crumbs and bins at the desks.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should see the costs. I'll look at the invoices for outside hire by the hour and quotes for the two fit-outs.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who actually uses it! I'll check the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is about the spirit of the office. I will look into unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
