30,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The wall is basically paper; you can hear everything. Also, people are eating at their desks, leaving crumbs everywhere.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We've spent 68,000 yen on outside rooms for tiny groups. The fit-out quotes are 141,000 for a meeting setup and 96,000 for a kitchen.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Rin,,Only two people use the room most of the time! And the old fridge was a mess that one person had to clean twice.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Servas,,"We've lost our space for unplanned talk, and the last difficult conversation happened right in front of everyone. It is quite sad.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Most of us spend twenty-five minutes just getting a hot lunch. Interestingly, the store room has had zero facilities callouts.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, if we spend that much on outside hire, a meeting space seems like a logical investment.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I suppose... but the kitchen is cheaper to install. I just don't want us to keep paying monthly for outside rooms.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Rin,,"But if only two people use it, why make it a big deal? And who is going to clean the kitchen?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, perhaps the lack of a proper space is why people don't use it. We need a place for honest, private talk.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"A kitchen would save those twenty-five-minute trips, but Rin is right about the cleaning. Someone always ends up doing it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, a meeting space provides that privacy. A kitchen just brings more crumbs and noise right next to my desk.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"If we have a meeting space, we stop the outside hire costs immediately. That seems the most stable.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want to be the one cleaning a fridge again! A quiet room or meeting room is much cleaner.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A quiet room might be too isolating. We need to reconnect as people, not just as workers.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we choose a meeting space, we must ensure the booking doesn't become another administrative burden.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
