55,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option B is the most logical. It solves the noise issue and the outside hire costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. Option B stops the financial leak of the hourly rentals.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I like Option B too! No one has to clean a fridge, and it's fairer than just ""first come, first served.""","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B allows for those awkward but necessary conversations to happen in private. I support it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B is acceptable. It avoids the upkeep of a kitchen and the inefficiency of walking for lunch.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Shion,,It seems we are all in agreement then.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Yes, the figures make sense for B.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Rin,,Yay! A real room with a screen!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Servas,,It is a step toward a more harmonious office.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,As long as the calendar is managed strictly.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Shion,,I'll vote for B.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for B.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Rin,,B for me!,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Servas,,I will also vote for B.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for B.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
